## Deploy strategy

${PLACEHOLDER2}: local | preview | staging | production (production always asks first).

## Permissions

${PLACEHOLDER2}: one bullet per tier-2 resource requested (free cloud resources, preview deploys), or "None".

## Risks and assumptions

${PLACEHOLDER2}: what could go wrong and what was assumed.

